      "rationale": "Derives linksIncomplete and the selected family entry from centerSelection and passes both into the one expressions element that every center variant renders (CenterExpressions). That element hands linksIncomplete to ReviewExpressions for a dataset review and the family entry to cardScope for a tree comparison. It also passes onRosterNext to the member, family and unavailable-member centers, so the partial-links notice and the user-driven roster continuation survive whichever view is shown.",
